	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Opening the new kiln room]]></title>
		<link>https://old.example.org/2024/03/opening-the-new-kiln-room/</link>
		<pubDate>Tue, 05 Mar 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[ana]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://old.example.org/?p=101</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[The new kiln arrived on a Tuesday &amp; it took four of us to carry it in. It's the first "proper" kiln we've owned.

<!--more-->

[caption id="attachment_201" align="aligncenter" width="300"]<a href="https://old.example.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/kiln-room.png"><img class="size-medium wp-image-201" src="https://old.example.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/kiln-room-300x200.png" alt="The kiln room with its new kiln" width="300" height="200" /></a> The kiln room, the week it opened[/caption]

Read our <a href="https://old.example.org/2024/03/glaze-notes/">glaze notes</a> before your first firing, check the <a href="https://old.example.org/opening-hours/">opening hours</a>, or browse the <a href="https://old.example.org/shop/">shop</a>.

Download the <a href="https://old.example.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/price-list.pdf">price list</a>.

<img src="https://old.example.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/missing-photo.png" alt="A photo that no longer exists" />]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
		<wp:post_id>101</wp:post_id>
		<wp:post_date><![CDATA[2024-03-05 10:00:00]]></wp:post_date>
		<wp:post_date_gmt><![CDATA[2024-03-05 10:00:00]]></wp:post_date_gmt>
		<wp:post_modified><![CDATA[2024-03-05 10:00:00]]></wp:post_modified>
