		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[[et_pb_section fb_built="1"][et_pb_row][et_pb_column type="4_4"][et_pb_text]<h2>Pots made for you</h2><p>Dinner sets, wedding gifts and one-off pieces.</p>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_button button_text="Start a commission" button_url="https://old.example.org/opening-hours/"][/et_pb_button][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section][et_pb_section][et_pb_row][et_pb_column type="1_3"][et_pb_blurb title="Talk" font_icon="%%1%%"]<p>Tell us what you need.</p>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_3"][et_pb_blurb title="Sketch" font_icon="%%2%%"]<p>We draw it and send a price.</p>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_3"][et_pb_blurb title="Make" font_icon="%%3%%"]<p>Six weeks later it's yours.</p>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section]]]></content:encoded>
